uasc: an owner holding every tenant at its location is no violation: true
uasc: one of several owners holding them suffices: true
uasc: a tenant whose node the owner holds only elsewhere is exactly one violation: true
uasc: the violation names the tenant, its pool and its offset: true
uasc: a retained arena with no owner list is a violation: true
uasc: a retained arena with no tenant is a violation: true
